  "content": "\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong> 你好！~ 歡迎來到 Potion Recipes: Vanilla Edition！</strong>\n</h4><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">透過這個資源包，您在調製藥水時將獲得額外的輔助，讓調製過程更加輕鬆，無論何時何地都能節省大量時間。\n<br>\n您所需的一切指引，都直接顯示在煉藥台介面中！\n<br>\n</h4><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/b46eb6k-TWw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span>\n\n<br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fpixelforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/32237a5eb0e69b0cfb6f79b09d08bafae2139664.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fshadows_pixelforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6f8e5473c7cc891773d0963a204a7dbc0cae6ab8.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/QrU6QCFj5r\" rel=\"nofollow\"> \n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ab1d9434d86f69f02be997775cc20d9f968fc6a6.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/shadowspixelforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fc15ed1de151999554a0a966e39ccaef439d6d4d.png\" alt=\"Twitch\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fshadowspixelforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2f10668a84476def0faf37c42319e0222484f94d.png\" alt=\"Instagram\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/shadowspixelforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b10f11429c9b97af2b45fcda64792d815fdeb5fb.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shadowspixelforge/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6aa1b4a7d469617ce0e922b931c24e73ef48dc59.png\" alt=\"Curseforge\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3qlCr9lXguH44qq5xqAlzQ\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/74af846b0dabfde51cc50f295809ec96f63e26a2.png\" alt=\"Youtube\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fSPixelForge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eb699f87a889d2710efc5dcff9b6b023b2be2d58.png\" alt=\"X\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a>\n<br><br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c504b5dd2e5b02ad181da50f0336314e6dd7572.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a2f227dd350f4e2322f500900863b7a6696b74f7.png\" alt=\"無需任何依賴\" width=\"660\" height=\"50\">\n<br><br>\n  <strong> 此資源包與原版 Minecraft 完美相容，完全不需要額外安裝模組。</strong> \n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c504b5dd2e5b02ad181da50f0336314e6dd7572.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/16b6589f1f80535554e90efd303b5eb53deccc80.png\" alt=\"擁抱黑暗面\" width=\"550\" height=\"50\">\n<br>\n<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/potion-recipes-dark-mode-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d0593dc091108c8dd613ae3b553c4ff977094f5a_0.webp\" alt=\"Potion Recipes: Dark Mode（暗黑模式）\" width=\"700\" height=\"50\"> </a>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c504b5dd2e5b02ad181da50f0336314e6dd7572.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c7f3b2837c699bc40bda584b7d5781389c4dbe3d.png\" alt=\"更多有趣專案\" width=\"690\" height=\"50\">\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<table style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;text-align:center\"> \n  <tr>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/shadows-pixels-reforged\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/81c5b3f05c13dac83081221b58110365ada040c7_0.webp\" alt=\"Shadow&#x27;s Pixels Reforged 圖示\" width=\"200\">\n      </a>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/the-night-of-living-pumpkins\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/243c0c1904de2361e931432a6e0e5b0ee6b27e8f.png\" alt=\"The Night of the Living Pumpkins 圖示\" width=\"200\">\n      </a>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/potion-recipes-pixels-reforged-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/543bdae3a809c8f18421b8c685cb5acf2ee52502.png\" alt=\"Potion Recipes: Pixels Reforged Edition 圖示\" width=\"200\">\n      </a>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c504b5dd2e5b02ad181da50f0336314e6dd7572.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n<br>\n<br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5f88863218a1c549051bc37c2cbd07a395d1bdd2.png\" alt=\"您的支持至關重要\" width=\"850\" height=\"50\">\n<br>\n<br>\n如果您喜歡我製作的内容，歡迎加入我的 Patreon 或 Ko-fi 支持計畫，享受所有專屬會員內容。您將能獲取大量額外福利，包括開發中的作品、製作過程影片、開發日誌等！\n<br>\n<br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fshadows_pixelforge%252ftiers\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6dc8719629fd05f40aba4f4e58bc56458925abae.png\" alt=\"加入 Ko-fi\" width=\"400\" height=\"50\"></a> \n<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shadowspixelforge/membership\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e73a4a0852508cb8d2b6a3dae2a42baef09334c0.png\" alt=\"加入 Patreon\" width=\"400\" height=\"50\"> </a> \n\n<br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c504b5dd2e5b02ad181da50f0336314e6dd7572.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fb424f5c7e4031e9d8691616a446883413c75421.png\" alt=\"常見問題\" width=\"155\" height=\"50\">\n\n</h4>\n以下整理了幾個您可能有的常見問題與解答，希望能對您有所幫助。\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n\n<h4><strong> 問：Potion Recipes: Vanilla Edition 是模組 / 整合包 / 數據包 / 外掛…嗎？ </strong></h4>\n- 答：不是，這只是一個資源包！\n<br><br><br>\n\n<h4><strong> 問：您會移植到基岩版（Bedrock）嗎？ </strong></h4>\n- 答：要推出基岩版相容的版本，我需要先學習基岩版的運作機制。因此目前暫無短期計畫，但未來終究會推出。\n<br><br><br>\n\n<h4><strong> 問：您會製作模組嗎？ </strong></h4>\n- 答：目前我主要專注於資源包，但不排除在不久的將來推出與藥水配方相關的新內容。\n<br><br><br>\n\n<h4><strong> 問：我可以將您的資源包放入我的整合包中嗎？ </strong></h4>\n- 答：可以，只要保留原作者署名即可。\n\n\n</div>",
